---
title: Desktop setup
description: "Prototype of the desktop app's first screen before it has a server. Switch between the drafts with `version`."
params:
  appearance: { enum: [light, dark], default: light }
  version: { enum: [second, first], default: second, description: "which draft to show" }
  step: { enum: [copy, paste, connecting, connected, arrived], default: copy, description: "second draft only: copy, paste, connecting, connected, or arrived" }
  server_theme: { enum: [clouds, none, nord, swiss, tokyo-night], default: clouds, description: "second draft only: the server's theme, which the interface wears" }
---
{% if version == "first" %}
{% render './setup-first' %}
{% else %}
{% render './setup-second', step: step, server_theme: server_theme %}
{% endif %}
